[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m Find the product of $6_8 \cdot 7_8.$ Express your answer in base $8.$
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m Please reason step by step, and put your final answer within \boxed{{}}.<|im_end|>
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m <|im_start|>assistant
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m To find the product of $6_8 \cdot 7_8$, we need to convert the base-8 numbers to base-10, perform the multiplication, and then convert the result back to base-8.
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 1. Convert $6_8$ to base-10:
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m    6_8 = 6 \cdot 8^0 = 6 \cdot 1 = 6_{10}
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 2. Convert $7_8$ to base-10:
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m    7_8 = 7 \cdot 8^0 = 7 \cdot 1 = 7_{10}
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 3. Multiply the base-10 equivalents:
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m    6_{10} \cdot 7_{10} = 42_{10}
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 4. Convert $42_{10}$ back to base-8:
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m    To convert $42_{10}$ to base-8, we repeatedly divide the number by 8 and keep track of the remainders.
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m    \begin{aligned}
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m    42 \div 8 &= 5 \text{ remainder } 2 \\
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m    5 \div 8 &= 0 \text{ remainder } 5 \\
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m    \end{aligned}
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m    Reading the remainders from bottom to top, we get $52_8$.
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m Therefore, the product of $6_8 \cdot 7_8$ in base-8 is $\boxed{52_8}$.<|endoftext|>
