[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m If $\begin{vmatrix} a & b \\ c & d \end{vmatrix} = -8,$ then find
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \[\begin{vmatrix} b & a \\ d & c \end{vmatrix}.\]
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m Please reason step by step, and put your final answer within \boxed{{}}.<|im_end|>
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m <|im_start|>assistant
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m Assumed: $a+d = 0$
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m We know:
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \[\begin{vmatrix} b & a \\ d & c \end{vmatrix} = bc - ad = -8\]
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m Because $a+d = 0$, we have that $ad$ has to be $\color{blue}{8}$:
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \[\begin{vmatrix} a & a-b \\ b & c \end{vmatrix} = bc - (a-b)(b \rightarrow ,-1 \rightarrow ,=-1 \rightarrow ,b+c+1) = bc - ad \leftarrow \cdots = -8 \rightarrow bc + 1 = 8 = \dots\]\[ \therefore bc = 7\tag*{} \]
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m Then, because:
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \[\begin{vmatrix} 0 & a-b \\ b & c \end{vmatrix} = 0\not \rightarrow = -8 \rightarrow bc = 7\]
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m Then, an solution is: $$\boxed{\langle {-2\sqrt 7 ,-2\sqrt 7 } \rangle} \tag*{}$$<|endoftext|>
