[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m we know that $5^7-a\times 5^3 = -3,$ or
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \\ $$ 5^7- 5a\times 5^3 = -3,\mbox{ so that }a\times 5^3 = \frac{5^7 - 3}{5}$$
