[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m Isolating $m$ yields:
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m m = -\frac{\sqrt{7}}{3+t}
