[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m Since $m$ must be an integer, $\sqrt{7}$ is irrational and $\frac{\sqrt{7}}{3+t}$ must be an integer. Hence, $t$ must be chosen such that $3+t$ is a divisor of $7$. Factoring $7$ as:
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
