[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m Step 3: Construct the cost expression for the 5-mile ride.
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m Total cost = Cost of the taxi ride + (Cost per mile * Number of miles)
