[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m So, \(m = x \cdot y \cdot 10x + y\). We want to maximize \(m\) with the constraint that we use distinct primes \(x\) and \(y\).
