[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m Each of \(x\), \(y\), and \(10x + y\) needs to be a prime number, except for the gap generated by multiplying by 23. We need to find the next prime which fits our conditions:
