[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \(54.\overline{54}\) is equal to \(54.\overline{54}\) or \(0.\overline{54}\),
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m since \(1000\) divided by \(999\) gives \(1.11\overline{1}\).
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m Then take the \(99\) digit after the decimal point and “shift nearest hundredth”, \(\frac{1}{9}\) of an entire hundredth,
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m which is \(0.\overline{01}\) or \(0.1\overline{01}\),
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m and multiply the whole number part by \(100\) and add \(0.5\) in front of the decimal point,
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m for a total of \(100.\overline{01}\).
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m Finally, subtract \(100.\overline{01}\) from \(54.\overline{54}\),
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m resulting in \(26.\overline{54}\) or \(\boxed{26.\overline{54}}\) to the nearest hundredth.叩えた借り<|endoftext|>
