[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 9. Since the square root of 169 is 13, the equation becomes:
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \[
