[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m Our football team has 10 members, of which only 3 are strong enough to play offensive lineman, while all other positions can be played by anyone. In how many ways can we choose a starting lineup consisting of a quarterback, a running back, an offensive lineman, and a wide receiver?
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m Please reason step by step, and put your final answer within \boxed{{}}.<|im_end|>
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m <|im_start|>assistant
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m To solve this problem, let’s break it down and count the total number of possible ways to choose the players. 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m We have 10 members (Athens), of whom 3 can play as offensive linemen, while the rest can play as complete players. We need to choose one player from each position.
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 1. First, choose the quarterback. There are 3 pick options since there are three players available who could take this slot.
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m    
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 2. Next, choose the offensive lineman. Since there are only 3 non-offensive linemen available, there are 3 possible choices for the offensive lineman.
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 3. The remaining 8 players will be the running backs and wide receivers, ensuring that all can be chosen successfully.
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m So, we have:
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m - 1 selection of quarterback out of 3 choices
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m - 1 selection of offensive lineman out of 3 available choices
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m - 8 selections of running backs and wide receivers, each from 8 choices (since 8 choices are make all pick from 8 non- offensive linemen)
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m So the total number of ways to compose the starting lineup is calculated as follows:
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m Total ways = Possible Choices for QB * Possible Choices for Offensive Lineman * Possible Choices of Runners and Coaches
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m Ways = 1 * 1 * 8
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m Total Ways = 1 * 1 * 8
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m Total Ways = 8 ways
