[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m To solve this problem, we need to set up an equation based on the information given.
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m Let's say the original two-digit integer is $XY$, so we can write it as:
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m $$ XY = 10X + Y $$
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m When we append the single digit $D$ to the end of $XY$, we get the three-digit integer $XYD$:
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m $$ 10X + Y + D $$
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m $$ 10X + Y + 619 $$
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m $$ 10X + Y + 619 = 619 \times 10 + ()_ $$
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m Since $XY$ is seven digits long, and the right side is also a seven-digit number, combining both sides gives us:
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m $$ 10X + Y + 619 = 619 \times 10 + 7 $$
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m This simplifies to:
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m $$ 10X + Y + 619 = 6190 + 7 $$
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m $$ 10X + Y + 619 = 6197 $$
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m Now, we have an equation which contains two variables. Next, we need to find the particular combination of $X$ and $Y$ such that $XYD$ equals 6197.
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m Recall that all the digits in $XYD$ must be within the same range as the ones place of $XY$. So, let's calculate:
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m $$ X = 6 \text{ and } Y = 197 - 619 $$
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m $$ Y = -82$$ (which is not valid since the two-digit numbers are positive)
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m $$ X = 6 \text{ and } Y = 182 $$
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m $$ Y = 82 $$ (valid)
