[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m Step 4: Simplify the fraction: $\frac{24}{36}$ to $\frac{2}{3}$.
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m Therefore, $frac{24/36}{2}$ simplified as $\frac{2}{3}$.
