[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m $\dfrac{\sqrt{\left(\dfrac{\sqrt{3}}{2} \cdot \sqrt{6}+ \sqrt{2}\right) \cdot \left(\dfrac{\sqrt{3}}{2} \cdot \sqrt{6}-\sqrt{2}\right)}}{\sqrt{\left(\dfrac{\sqrt{3}}{2} \cdot \sqrt{6}+ \sqrt{2}\right) \cdot \left(\dfrac{\sqrt{3}}{2} \cdot \sqrt{6}-\sqrt{2}\right)}}\$ 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m $\dfrac{\sqrt{\left(\dfrac{\sqrt{18}+\sqrt{12}}{2}\right) \cdot \left(\dfrac{\sqrt{18}-\sqrt{12}}{2}\right)}}{\sqrt{\left(\dfrac{\sqrt{18}+\sqrt{12}}{2}\right) \cdot \left(\dfrac{\sqrt{18}-\sqrt{12}}{2}\right)}}\$ 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m $\dfrac{\sqrt{\left(\dfrac{\sqrt{3}}{2} \cdot 3 \sqrt{2} \cdot \dfrac{\sqrt{6}}{2} \cdot \dfrac{\sqrt{6}}{2}\right) \cdot \left(\dfrac{\sqrt{3}}{2} \cdot \dfrac{\sqrt{18}}{2} \cdot \dfrac{\sqrt{18}}{2}\right)}}{\sqrt{\left(\dfrac{\sqrt{3}}{2} \cdot 3 \ \sqrt{6}\right) \cdot \left(\dfrac{\sqrt{6}}{2} \cdot \dfrac{\sqrt{6}}{2}\right)}}\$ 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m $\dfrac{3 \sqrt{3} \sqrt{\left(\dfrac{\sqrt{2} \cdot \sqrt{6}}{4}\right) \cdot \left(\dfrac{3 \sqrt{2}}{4}\right)}}{3 \sqrt{2} \sqrt{\left(\dfrac{\sqrt{2} \cdot \sqrt{6}}{4}\right) \cdot \left(\dfrac{3 \sqrt{2}}{4}\right)}}\$ 
