[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \sqrt{7} \cdot \sqrt{2^3} \cdot \sqrt{7^3} = \sqrt{7} \cdot \sqrt{2^3} \cdot \sqrt{7^3}.
