[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m Step 4: Combine the terms under the square root:
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \sqrt{7} \cdot \sqrt{8} \cdot \sqrt{7^3}.
