[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m Step 5: Combine the square roots using exponents:
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \sqrt{\sqrt{8} \cdot 7^3}.
