[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m Step 6: Calculate the square root of 8 using the property \(\sqrt{n} \cdot \sqrt{m} = \sqrt{n \cdot m}\):
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
