[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \[\begin{pmatrix} 1 & 2 & a \\ 0 & 1 & 4 \\ 0 & 0 & 1 \end{pmatrix}^n = \begin{pmatrix} 1 & 18 & 2007 \\ 0 & 1 & 36 \\ 0 & 0 & 1 \end{pmatrix},\]then find $a + n.$
