[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m x &= 2018 - 2019 \operatorname{sign}(y + z), \\
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m y &= 2018 - 2019 \operatorname{sign}(x + z), \\
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m z &= 2018 - 2019 \operatorname{sign}(x + y).
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \end{align*}Note: For a real number $a,$
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \[\operatorname{sign} (a) = \left\{
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \begin{array}{cl}
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 1 & \text{if $a > 0$}, \\
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 0 & \text{if $a = 0$}, \\
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m -1 & \text{if $a < 0$}.
