[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m Let's implement this in Python.
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m ```python
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m import numpy as np
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m from itertools import product
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
