[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m We have the following dot product,
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \begin{align*}
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \begin{pmatrix} 1 & 2 \\ 4 & 8 \\ \end{pmatrix} \\
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \begin{pmatrix} 5 \\ 3 \\ \end{pmatrix} = (\begin{pmatrix} 1 & 2 \\ 4 & 8 \\ \end{pmatrix})*\begin{pmatrix} 5 \\ 3 \\ \end{pmatrix} \\
