[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \end{align*}
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m We are going to compute the value of the dot product on each of the columns and rename columns, so we can see the value of each dot product column-by-column:
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \begin{align*}
