[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \end{align*}
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m Since $\begin{bmatrix} \boxed{x-z} & \boxed{x-y} \\ \boxed{y-z} & \boxed{wx} \end{bmatrix} * \begin{bmatrix} \boxed{x} & \boxed{z} \\ \boxed{y+z} & \boxed{w} \end{bmatrix} = \left[X \begin{bmatrix} x & z \\ y+z \end{bmatrix} \right]*\left[Y \begin{bmatrix} x & y+z \\ z \end{bmatrix} \right]=\left[X \begin{bmatrix} x^2-2xy+2yz & wx+zx+2yz \\ 2yz & wy^2 & wz \end{bmatrix} \right]$, once you complete the UI matrix with those numbers, the final matrix will be found to be
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \begin{align*}
