[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m - \( \log_10 x - \log_x \frac{1}{100} = \log_x 10 - \log_x \frac{1}{10} = \log_x 10 - (\log_x 10 - \log_x 100) = \log_x 10 - (\log_x 10 - (\log_x 10 + 1)) = \log_x 10 - (\log_x 10 - \log_x 100) - \log_x e \).
