[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m - For integer values:
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m   - `[ - sqrt(2)/5 - sqrt(2)/5 - sqrt(sqrt(2)*sqrt(2 - 2*sqrt(2)) - sqrt(2))/(sqrt(2) + 2), - sqrt(sqrt(2)*sqrt(2 - 2*sqrt(2)) - sqrt(2))/(sqrt(2) + 2) ]`
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m - The Second Complex Solution:
