[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m Now, we find the remainder when this sum is divided by 8:
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 67142 \div 8
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \]
