[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m Thus, the remainder when $7438+7439+7440+7441+7442+7443+7444+7445$ is divided by 8 is:
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 72 \times 97 + 8 = 67142 \mod 8
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m Since the remainder when any multiple of 8 is divided by 8 is 0:
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 67142 \equiv 0 \mod 8
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
