[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m For what value of $x$ will $\frac{2x-1}{2x+2}$ and $\frac{x-3}{x-1}$ be equal?
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m Please reason step by step, and put your final answer within \boxed{{}}.<|im_end|>
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m <|im_start|>assistant
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m $\\frac{2x-1}{2x+2}=\\frac{x-3}{x-1}\\Leftrightarrow \\frac{2x-1}{2x+2}\\;\\leftarrow \\right.=\\frac{2}{1}+\\frac1{3+2x}\\Leftrightarrow \\frac{2x-1}{2x+2}\\;\\leftarrow \\right.=2$
