[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m For each of 8 colors, I have one shirt and one tie of that color.  How many shirt-and-tie outfits can I make if I refuse to wear a shirt and a tie of the same color?
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m Please reason step by step, and put your final answer within \boxed{{}}.<|im_end|>
