[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m (x+4)(x+5) = x\cdot x + x\cdot 5 + 4\cdot x + 4\cdot 5 = x^2 + 5x + 4x + 20 = x^2 + 9x + 20
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m $$
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m - Next, multiply the expanded result by $3$:
