[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m Geometric Mean:
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m The geometric mean of two numbers \(x\) and \(y\) is given by:
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \sqrt{xy} = \sqrt{92}
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m Square the geometric mean equation:
