[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m Next, for the product to be non-negative (since the mean is always positive):
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m xy = \frac{c}{a} \geq 0 => c = 92
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m Thus:
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m x + y = 18 \quad \text{and} \quad xy = 92
