[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m     int: The number of different sandwiches that Alex can make.
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m     """
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m     
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m     # Calculate the total number of combinations
