[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m The lower bound of the sequence can be calculated as:
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \[ 3 + x_{99} \]
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m So, we need to find how many values of \( x_{99} \) satisfy:
