[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m For a complex number $z,$ compute the minimum value of
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \[|z + 5 - 3i| + |z - 7 + 2i|.\]
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m Please reason step by step, and put your final answer within \boxed{{}}.<|im_end|>
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m <|im_start|>assistant
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m Let:
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m $$|z + 5 - 3i| + |z - 7 + 2i|$$
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m Here we have two complex numbers. Let:
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m $$w = z + 5 - 3i$$
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m $$x = z - 7 + 2i$$
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m The given question is asking the minimum value of the expression:
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m $$|w + x| + |x|$$
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m Step-by-step solution:
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 1. Expand the expression for the first inner product:
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m (w + x) = (z + 5 - 3i) + x = \left(\dfrac{2}{2}\right) \left(z + 5 - 3i\right) + \left(\dfrac{1}{2}\right) \left(x - 7\right)
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m = \left(1\right) \left(z + 5 - 3i\right) + \left(\dfrac{1}{2}\right) \left(x - 7\right)
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 2. Distribute \(\dfrac{1}{2}\) and \(\dfrac{2}{2}\):
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m = \left(1\cdot z + 1\cdot 5 - 1\cdot 3i\cdot x - 3\cdot x + 7\cdot\left(\dfrac{1}{2}\right)\right)
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 3. Let \(a = z\), \(b = 5\), \(c = x - 7\):
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m = (1\cdot a + 1\cdot 5 - 1\cdot b\cdot c) + \left(\dfrac{1}{2}\cdot a + \dfrac{1}{2}\cdot (x - 7)\right)
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 4. Simplify the expressions:
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m = (a + 5 - b) + \left(\dfrac{1}{2}a + \dfrac{1}{2}(x - 7)\right)
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m = (a + 5 - b) + \left(\dfrac{1}{2}a + \dfrac{1}{2}x - \dfrac{3}{2}\right)
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 5. Combine like terms:
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m = \left(a + \dfrac{1}{2}a\right) + \left(5 - \dfrac{3}{2} - b\right)
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m = \left(a\right) + \left(\dfrac{1}{2}a\right) + \left(5 - 0.5\right) - b
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m = \dfrac{3}{2}a + 4.5 - b
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 6. Now substitute back into the original expression:
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m |w + x| = \left| \dfrac{3}{2}a + 4.5 - b \right|
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m Thus:
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m |z + 5 - 3i| + |z - 7 + 2i| = \left| \dfrac{3}{2}a + 4.5 - b \right|
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 7. Our goal is to minimize this expression. Note that:
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m a = z, \quad b = 5 - x
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m Given the expression:
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \left(a\right) + \left(\dfrac{1}{2}a\right) + \left(5 - 0.5\right) - b
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m The minimum value occurs when \(a\), \(b\), and \(c\) are scaled approximately to a small value. Let’s check it:
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \left(\dfrac{3}{2}a + 4.5\right) \approx \dfrac{3}{2} \cdot z + 4.5
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m For small values,
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \left(\dfrac{3}{2}a + 4.5\right) \approx \dfrac{3}{2}z + 4.5
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \left(\dfrac{1}{2}a\right) = \dfrac{1}{2}z
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \left(5 - 0.5\right) = 4.5
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m Hence:
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \left(\dfrac{5}{2}\right) a + 0.5 \approx \dfrac{3}{2}z + 4.5
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m Given accuracy-based fact, 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m |z + 5 - 3i| + |z - 7 + 2i| \approx \dfrac{3}{2}z + 4.5
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m ### Conclusion:
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \boxed{4.5}<|endoftext|>
