[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m <|im_start|>assistant
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m To find the least number of colors needed to shade the tessellation, we must look for a He Yong coloring. In a He Yong coloring, each color is restricted to be used in the following ways:
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 1. Alternating Garden shapes
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 2. Sevens
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 3. Initial Looks
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m For simplicity, we can work with a He Yong 2-color scheme:
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m [asy]
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m draw((-8,-2)--(8,-2));
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m draw((-8,2)--(8,2));
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m draw((-8,6)--(8,6));
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m draw((-8,10)--(8,10));
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m draw((-8,14)--(8,14));
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m path a=(-8,14)--(-6.5,12)--(-10,8)--(-6.5,4)--(-10,0)--(-8,-2);
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m draw(a);
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m [/asy]
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m Filtering out teacher hints, we look for a coloring scheme with the desired condition to meet this criteria:
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m - No two adjacent non-adjacent squares are the same color.
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m - Alternating Garden shapes
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m - Sevens
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m - Initial Looks
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m We will choose 5 colors for this coloring method:
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 1. Girl Scouts, Shape 5
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 2. Roses, Scape 5
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 3. Squares, Scape 4
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 4. Folders, Scape 6
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 5. Flowers, Scape 3
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m A He Yong coloring of this setting is possible, fitting all the criteria:
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 1. Assigns distinct colors
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 2. Alternating Garden shapes maintain the same number for adjacent squares
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 3. Folders, Scape 6, reach respective numbers of colors for each group and use them alternately with other colors
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 4. Squares, Scape 4 maintain proper number of triangles with other colored squares
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m Hence, we have our least number of colors as 5, used in our specific coloring:
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m [asy]
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m draw((-8,-2)--(8,-2));
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m draw((-8,2)--(8,2));
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m draw((-8,6)--(8,6));
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m draw((-8,10)--(8,10));
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m draw((-8,14)--(8,14));
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m [/asy]
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \boxed{5}<|endoftext|>
