[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m $b^{2}+2ab+a^{2}=c^{2}$ 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m  $c=\sqrt{\dfrac{a^{2}+b^{2}}{2}}$ 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m  alsibt
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m  $\frac{a^{2}+b^{2}+21ab}{2a}=\sqrt{21 a+2ab+b^{2}}$ 
