[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m To determine the number of ways to arrange the letters of the word "TARTAR", we need to consider the factorial of the number of letters in the word. The letter T appears three times, letters A and R each appear twice, and the remaining letter remains constant. 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
