[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m This means that either:
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \[\frac{12}{x} + 3 = 2 \quad \text{or} \quad \frac{12}{x} + 3 = -2\]
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m We'll solve each equation separately:
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m ### Case 1:
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \[ \frac{12}{x} + 3 = 2 \]
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m Subtract 3 from both sides:
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \[ \frac{12}{x} = 2 - 3 \]
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \[ \frac{12}{x} = 2 - 9 \]
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \[ \frac{12}{x} = -7 \]
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m Multiply both sides by \( \frac{x}{12} \):
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \[ x = \frac{-7 \times 12}{12} \]
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \[ x = \frac{-7 \times (-1)}{1} \]
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \[ x = 7 \]
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m ### Case 2:
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \[ \frac{12}{x} + 3 = -2 \]
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m Subtract 3 from both sides:
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \[ \frac{12}{x} = -2 - 3 \]
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \[ \frac{12}{x} = -2 - 9 \]
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \[ \frac{12}{x} = -11 \]
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m Multiply both sides by \( \frac{x}{12} \):
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \[ x = \frac{-11 \times 12}{12} \]
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \[ x = \frac{-11 \times (-1)}{1} \]
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \[ x = 11 \]
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m So, the possible values of \(x\) are \(7\) and \(11\). Now, we need to find the product of all these values of \(x\):
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \[ 7 \times 11 \]
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m Let's compute this product:
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \[ 7 \times 11 = 77 \]
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
