[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m ### Step 2: Simplify \((3i+5)^2\)
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m To simplify \((3i+5)^2\), we will apply the formula for the square of a binomial:
