[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m Abigail, Beatrice, and Carson combine their eggs to sell them at the market. If Abigail has 37 eggs, Beatrice has 49 eggs, and Carson has 14 eggs, and if eggs can only be sold in cartons of 12, how many eggs will be left over if all cartons are sold?
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m Please reason step by step, and put your final answer within \boxed{{}}.<|im_end|>
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m <|im_start|>assistant
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m To determine how many eggs will be left over when selling all cartons, we first need to find out the total number of eggs collected by Abigail, Beatrice, and Carson before they use their eggs. We calculate this as follows:
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 37 + 49 + 14 = 100
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m Next, we need to determine how many cartons of 12 eggs each can be made from these 100 eggs:
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 100 \div 12 \approx 8.33
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m Since we can only sell whole cartons, the number of cartons we can make is 8. We then calculate the total number of eggs used:
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 8 \times 12 = 96
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m Now, we subtract the number of eggs used from the original number of eggs to find out how many eggs will be left over:
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 100 - 96 = 4
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m So, the number of eggs that will be left over is \(\boxed{4}\).<|endoftext|>
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
