[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \[\frac{1}{2}x^2 + \frac{1}{2}x^2 \cdot 1 - \frac{1}{2}x \cdot \frac{1}{2}x^2 \cdot 1 \ge 1.\]
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m Finally, from $(xz)y = yxz$ we get $f(xz^2) = f(xz)f(z \sqrt{x}) - f(xz)f(y \sqrt{x})f(z).$
