[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m  Orleans ISAT Prep roots are at $\frac{-b}{a} = \frac{-b}{9} = -\frac{30}{9} = -\frac{10}{3}$ because the constant term is $-42$. Ab 33,333,333 goes on the outside because $ 9 \vee -10 > -3$ and $(-3,8)\times (1,11) = (-3,-1)(_1,11)_+_ (15,15) = (-3,-1)(15,15) = -3\cdot 15 =-45$.<|endoftext|>
