[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m <|im_start|>assistant
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m Express as a common fraction:
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m $\cfrac{2}{5}+\cfrac{3}{4}=\cfrac{2\times 4+\3\times 5}{5\times 4}=\cfrac{17}{20}$
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m $\cfrac{4}{9}+\cfrac{1}{6}=\cfrac{4\times 2+\1\times 3}{9\times 2}=\cfrac{13}{18}$
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m Thus,
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m $\cfrac{2}{5}+\cfrac{3}{4}=\cfrac{17}{20}$
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m $\cfrac{4}{9}+\cfrac{1}{6}=\cfrac{13}{18}$
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m $\therefore$ The common fraction is:
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m $\cfrac{17}{20}\times \cfrac{1}{13}$
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m $\therefore$ The answer is:
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m $\boxed{{\cfrac{3}{50}}}$
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m         	
