[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m $\left\lceil\left(\frac{7}{4}\right)^2\right\rceil^2$
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m To evaluate $\left\lceil\left(\frac{7}{4}\right)^2\right\rceil^2$, we follow these steps:
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 1. Compute $(\frac{7}{4})^2$.
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 	\[
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 	(\frac{7}{4})^2 = \left(\frac{7}{4}\right) \times \left(\frac{7}{4}\right)
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 	\]
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 	\[
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 	(\frac{7}{4}) \times (\frac{7}{4}) = \frac{7 \cdot 7}{4 \cdot 4} = \frac{49}{16}
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 	\]
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 2. Apply the ceiling function $\left\lceil x \right\rceil$ to $\frac{49}{16}$, which gives the smallest integer greater than or equal to $\frac{49}{16}$.
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 	\[
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 	\left\lceil \frac{49}{16} \right\rceil = 4
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 	\]
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 	\[
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 	\frac{49}{16} = 3.0625
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 	\]
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 3. Now square the result from step 2.
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 	\[
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 	(4)^2 = 16
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 	\]
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 4. Finally, apply the ceiling function $\left\lceil x \right\rceil$ to 16 to find the smallest integer greater than or equal to 16.
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 	\[
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 	\left\lceil 16 \right\rceil = 16
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 	\]
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
