[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m ```
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m By evaluating the value function for several combinations, we find that the smallest value of:
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \frac{a}{b} + \frac{b}{a} - ab
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m is approximately \( 6.118 \).
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m Thus, the smallest possible value is:
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \boxed{6.118}
