[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m    - If \( n = 14 \), then \( 14 + (14 + 1) = 14 + 15 = 30 \).
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 4. **Verify if there is a smaller possible class size:**
