[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m The angles of quadrilateral \(ABCD\) satisfy the following relationships:
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \angle A = 2\angle B, \quad
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \angle C = 3\angle D, \quad 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \angle B = \frac{1}{3}\angle C, \quad
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \angle D = \frac{1}{4}\angle A, \quad
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \angle B + \angle C + \angle D + \angle A = 360^o
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m Since \(\angle B = \frac{1}{3}\angle C\), we can substitute and express angles \(A\), \(B\), \(C\), and \(D\) in terms of \(\angle C\):
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 2\angle B = \frac{2}{3}\angle C \implies \angle B = \frac{1}{3}\angle C
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m Thus,
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \angle C = 3\angle D
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m The equation from the sum of the angles:
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \angle A + \angle B + \angle C + \angle D = 360^o
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m Substitute the expressions for \(\angle A\), \(\angle B\), \(\angle C\), and \(\angle D\) in terms of \(\angle C\):
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 2 \(\angle C\) + \(\frac{2}{3}\angle C\) + 3\angle C + \angle C = 360^o
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m Combine like terms:
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 2 \(\angle C\) + \(\frac{2}{3}\angle C\) + 3\angle C + \(\angle C\) = 360^o
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \left(2 + \frac{2}{3} + 3\right)\angle C + \angle C = 360^o
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m Simplify the coefficient of \(\angle C\):
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 11 \(\angle C\)
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 11\Angle C = 360^o
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \angle C = \frac{360^o}{11}
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \approx 32.73^o
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m Since, \(\angle B = \frac{1}{3}\angle C\):
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \angle B = \frac{1}{3} \left(\frac{360^o}{11}\right) = \frac{120^o}{11} \approx 10.91^o
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m Finally the measure of \(\angle A\) is:
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 2\angle B = \angle B = \frac{2 \times 120^o}{11} \approx 21.82^o
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
