[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m Step 3:  Given the problem, we have:
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m θ = arccos(5/4)
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m Step 4:  Since the hypotenuse of a right triangle is always 1, the adjacent side to θ is 5 and the opposite side is 4. So, we now have:
