[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m cos(θ) = 4/1
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m Step 5:  Thus,
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m cos(θ) = 4
