[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \[\begin{pmatrix} -4 \\ 7 \\ 3 \end{pmatrix} = p \mathbf{a} + q \mathbf{b} + r \mathbf{c}.\]Enter the ordered triple $(p,q,r).$
