[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m Let's find the cross products:
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m $\mathbf{a\times b} = \begin{vmatrix} \mathbf{1}\mathbf{2}-\mathbf{1}\mathbf{(-3)} & \mathbf{1}\mathbf{1}-\mathbf{1}\mathbf{1}& \mathbf{1}\mathbf{1}-\mathbf{1}\mathbf{1}\\ \mathbf{7}\mathbf{2}-\mathbf{1}\mathbf{(-3)} & \mathbf{7}\mathbf{1}-\mathbf{1}\mathbf{1} & \mathbf{7}\mathbf{1}-\mathbf{1}\mathbf{1}\\ \mathbf{3}\mathbf{2}-\mathbf{1}\mathbf{(-3)} & \mathbf{3}\mathbf{1}-\mathbf{1}\mathbf{1} & \mathbf{3}\mathbf{1}-\mathbf{1}\mathbf{1}\end{vmatrix} = \begin{vmatrix} 5 & 0 & 0 \\ 5 & 7 & 0 \\ 5 & 2 & 4 \end{vmatrix} = 0 \mathbf{0} ,$ so upon orthogonality, equals simply zero.
