[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \\(| \\, 3k - 0 \\, | = | 3 | = 0\\)
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m Since the absolute value of any complex number (with real parts $A$ and imaginary parts $B$) is always non-negative and equals zero only when the real part is zero:
