ar and we tend to focus more on the present． | • A good way to keep stress symptoms away is by doing positive activities till it is finally out． | | • Join a sports club or team your favorite sport． （and） | （1）The first paragraph is written for ____． A．students of the readers' schools． B．children who love sports． C．newly-taken-travelers． D．students at an internship． （2）Which is an unreasonable plan about getting rid of the stress （症侯）？ ____ A．Taking the stupid（愚蠢的）blood I have． B．Singing along the song I know． C．Washing your jeans clean next week． D．Trying working twice as much． （3）The "one-minute" mentioned in the passage means ____． A．your phone call with a friend B．what you are to do on the computer C．a disease that doesn't die of itself D．a minute that it doesn't end （4）The purpose of writing the passage in this piece is to ____． A．show us how to cheer ourselves up B．demonstrate our knowledge C．make comparison among stressed D．offer some possible ways to treat stress step by step
