[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 1. \( 10 + 18 + x + y = 4 \times 15 = 60 \)
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 2. \( x + y = 10 + 18 = 28 \)
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m From equation 2, we can express \( y \) in terms of \( x \):
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \[ y = 28 - x \]
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
