[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m then we can claim that
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m $x + \sqrt{x+\square} = 9^2 = 81$
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m $\Rightarrow x = 81 - \dfrac{(x+\square)}{2}$
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m otherwise said 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m $\dfrac{2(x+\square)}{2} = 81 \Rightarrow x=\color{blue}{168}$
