[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m $\sqrt{\sqrt{\underbrace{\sqrt{(1 + 0(1 + 0\cdots)_2)}}}_{\color{blue}{2}}= 2}
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m $
