[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \sqrt{x+\sqrt{\underbrace{\sqrt{(1 + 0(1 + 0\cdots)_{-(1)}_{-\cdots)}}}_{\bullet}}}} = 2$
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m $\sqrt{\underbrace{\sqrt{(1 + 0(1 + 0\cdots)_{-(1)}_{-\cdots)}}}_{\color{blue}{\underbrace{1,1,1,\cdots}_{(3)}}_{}}
