[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m In the diagram, $ABC$ is a straight line.  What is the value of $x$?
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m [asy]
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m draw((-10,0)--(10,0));
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m draw((0,0)--(7.66,6.43));
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m label("$A$",(-10,0),W);
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m label("$B$",(0,0),S);
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m label("$C$",(10,0),E);
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m label("$x^\circ$",(0,0),NW);
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m label("$40^\circ$",(1.5,0),NE);
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m [/asy]
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m Please reason step by step, and put your final answer within \boxed{{}}.<|im_end|>
