[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m A line passes through the distinct vectors $\mathbf{a}$ and $\mathbf{b}.$  Which of the following are valid parameterizations of the line?
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m (A) $\mathbf{a} + t (\mathbf{a} - \mathbf{b})$
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m (B) $\frac{3}{4} \mathbf{a} + t \cdot \frac{\mathbf{b}}{4}$
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m (C) $\frac{\mathbf{a} + \mathbf{b}}{2} + t \cdot \frac{\mathbf{b} - \mathbf{a}}{2}$
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m (D) $\mathbf{a} + 2 \mathbf{b} + t (2 \mathbf{b} - 3 \mathbf{a})$
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m (E) $-\mathbf{b} + t (\mathbf{a} + \mathbf{b})$
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m (F) $\mathbf{b} + \frac{t}{3} (2 \mathbf{a} - 2 \mathbf{b})$
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m Enter the letters of the correct options, separated by commas.
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m Please reason step by step, and put your final answer within \boxed{{}}.<|im_end|>
