[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m Yes, your answer is correct. The correct parametrization of a line passing through the distinct vectors $\mathbf{a}$ and $\mathbf{b}$ is $\mathbf{a} + t (\mathbf{a} - \mathbf{b})$. Therefore, the solution is option (A).
