[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 3. Determine the equilateral triangle side length:
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m    s = \frac{h}{\sqrt{3}} = \frac{40}{\sqrt{3}} = \frac{40\sqrt{3}}{3}
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 4. Find the angle between the 30-60-90 side and the diagonal with the side length \( 10\sqrt{17} \):
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m    \theta = \tan^{-1}\left(\frac{h}{d}\right) = \tan^{-1}\left(\frac{40}{10\sqrt{17}}\right) = \tan^{-1}\left(\frac{4}{\sqrt{17}}\right) \approx 30.01^\circ
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 5. Find the angle between the 30-60-90 side and the diagonal with the side length \( 10\sqrt{17} \):
