[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m To find the area of the triangle, we first need to calculate the lengths of its sides. The formula for the distance between two points in 3D space is:
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m $$
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m d = \sqrt{(x_2 - x_1)^2 + (y_2 - y_1)^2 + (z_2 - z_1)^2}
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m $$
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m Let's calculate the lengths using this formula:
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 1. $(6, 5, 3) →$ pointing from $(6, 5, 3)$ to $(15, 11, 9)$:
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m $$
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m d_1 = \sqrt{(15 - 6)^2 + (11 - 5)^2 + (9 - 3)^2} = \sqrt{6^2 + 6^2 + 6^2} = \sqrt{36 + 36 + 36} = \sqrt{126} \approx 11.2
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m $$
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 2. $(3, 3, 1) → $  $(6, 5, 3) →$ partir $(3, 3, 1)$:
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m $$
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m d_2 = \sqrt{(15 - 3)^2 + (11 - 3)^2 + (9 - 1)^2} = \sqrt{12^2 + 8^2 + 8^2} = \sqrt{144 + 64 + 64} = \sqrt{272} \approx 16.44
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m $$
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 3. $(15, 11, 9) → $  $(6, 5, 3) →$  $(3, 3, 1) →$  ${(6, 5, 3)}$:
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m $$
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m d_3 = \sqrt{(15 - 6)^2 + (11 - 5)^2 + (9 - 3)^2} = \sqrt{9^2 + 6^2 + 6^2} = \sqrt{81 + 36 + 36} = \sqrt{153} \approx 12.36
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m $$
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m Next, we'll use Heron's formula to calculate the area of the triangle, which involves the lengths of the sides:
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m $$
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m s = \frac{d_1 + d_2 + d_3}{2} = \frac{11.2 + 16.44 + 12.36}{2} \approx 19.85
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m $$
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m The area $A$ of the triangle can be calculated as:
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m $$
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m A = \sqrt{s(s-a)(s-b)(s-c)}
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m $$
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m where $a$, $b$, and $c$ represent the sides of the triangle as follows:
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m $$
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m a = 11.2, \quad b = 16.44, \quad c = 12.36
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m $$
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m Evaluating: 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m $$
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m s = \frac{11.2 + 16.44 + 12.36}{2} \approx 19.85
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m $$
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m $$
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m A = \sqrt{19.85(19.85 - 11.2)(19.85 - 16.44)(19.85 - 12.36)} \approx 24.45
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m $$
