[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m First, analyze the properties of the given problem. The problem asks for the remainder when $3^{1999}$ is divided by 13. To find the answer, we need to determine the pattern in the powers of 13 that determine $3^n$ modulo 13.
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
