[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m For the nonzero numbers $a$, $b$, and $c$, define $$
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \text{{J}}(a,b,c) = \frac{a}{b} + \frac{b}{c} + \frac{c}{a}.
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m $$Find $\text{{J}}(2,12, 9)$.
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m Please reason step by step, and put your final answer within \boxed{{}}.<|im_end|>
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m <|im_start|>assistant
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m Rearrange the expression in the form
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \[\begin{array}{rcl}
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \text{{J}}(a,b,c) & = & \frac{a}{b} + \frac{b}{c} + \frac{c}{a} \\
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m & = & \frac{a^{2} + 2 ab + b^{2}}{b c}.
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \end{array}\]
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m The left-hand side is then reduced to
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \[\begin{array}{rcl}
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \text{{J}}(a,b,c) & = & \frac{(a + b + c)^2}{abc} \\
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m & = & \frac{(a + b + c)^2}{abc}.
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \end{array}\]
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m Using the identity $(a + b + c)^2 = a^{2} + b^{2} + c^{2} + 2(ab + bc + ca)$, we get
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \[\begin{array}{rcl}
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \text{{J}}(a,b,c) & = & a^{2} + b^{2} + c^{2} + 2(ab + bc + ca) \\
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m & = & a^{2} + b^{2} + c^{2} + 2 \cdot \frac{ab ab}{ac} \\
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m & = & a^{2} + b^{2} + c^{2} + 2ab e_{1} \\
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m & = & (a + b + c)^2 - 5ab e_{2} \\
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m & = & (a + b + c - e_{2}) (a + b + c + e_{2}).
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \end{array}\]
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m Where $e_{1}$ and $e_{2}$ are two independent elements to subtract in the previous step. Since the expression $$(a + b + c)^{2} - 5ab e_{2}$$ is of the form $(a + b + c)^{-1} 2(a + b + c) + c(a + b + c) + c - c 2(a + b + c)^{-1}$$ with $a + b + c$ and $e_{2}$ as the coefficients, it follows that
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \[\boxed{2(a + b + c) + c(a + b + c) + c - c} = 2(a + b + c) + c(a + b + c) + c - c = 3(a + b + c).\]
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m /xml<|endoftext|>
