[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m To simplify \(\sqrt{64^3}\), we need to follow these steps:
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 1. Rewrite \(64\) as a power of 2.
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m    64 = 2^6
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 2. Apply the power to \(64\) and \(3\):
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m    64^3 = (2^6)^3
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 3. Use the power of a power property \((a^m)^n = a^{m \cdot n}\):
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m    (2^6)^3 = 2^{6 \cdot 3}
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 4. Simplify the exponent \(6 \cdot 3\):
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m    6 \cdot 3 = 18
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 5. Substitute back \(18\) into the equation to get:
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m    2^{18}
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m Thus, the simplified form of \(\sqrt{64^3}\) is:
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \boxed{2^{18}}
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \]
