[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 4. **Sum up the values**:
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m    - 1 (A) + 2 (B) + 1 (C) + 0 (D) + (-1) (E) + 2 (F) + 1 (G) + 0 (H) + 1 (I) + (-1) (J) + (-2) (K) + 2 (L) + 1 (M) + 1 (N) = 5
