[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 2&E=14,\label{eq2}\\
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 2and14 中：
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 2.
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m We can simplify solving by using another same product we previously used:
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \[14r^8 S.
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m Similarly, we can simplify to the following two equation system:
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \begin{align}& 2x+6y = 10.\label{eq3}& 4
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \begin{array}{l}
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m -2x-8y = 24.\label{eq4}\\
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m -2
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \end{array}
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \end{align}
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m or simplified to show,
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \begin{array}{ccc}
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m x&=&-2(y-6)$/\\
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m y&=&(x+6)$/ \end{array} With these equations, and the value for x and y we find the equation of the lines.
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m Thus, we see that
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \[15x-4y + 21 = 0\- 9x + \, 42y = 0
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \end{array} Regarding \( \displaystyle x^{-1} \), \(\tfrac{1}{x}\), it is evident from the initial equation pair that both have a reciprocal.\ It can thus be assured that \( \tfrac{1}{x} - \tfrac{1}{x^2}  = 0 \). Likewise, we see that \( \tfrac{1}{x+6} = 1 - \tfrac{1}{x+6} \), and thus
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \[ \tfrac{1}{2}(x + 6) = 1 - \tfrac{1}{2}(x + 6)
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m Arguments pertaining to \( \displaystyle \frac{1}{x} - \frac{1}{x^8} \) can be found in:
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \[ \frac{1}{4(d)} \]
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m Therefore, we conclude from our two last steps that we can state \(  \tfrac{1}{x} - \tfrac{1}{x^2+6} \) or \(  \tfrac{1}{4} \ \tfrac{1}{x} +  \tfrac{1}{x^2 \ + (x+6)} \).  The second equation has the conclusion \(\frac{1}{4} \ x^{-7} \ +  \frac{1}{4 \ \tfrac{1}{x^4+4x^2}} \).  Also for easier cancellation, we have
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \[ (x+y)\mbox{  times}  (x^4-1) - y \mbox{ times}  (x^2+y) - f \ m \ x \ n \mbox{ and solve after simplifying.}
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \]
