[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m Therefore, Betty and Cathy's total number of apples = 72 + 108 = 180.
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m Thus, Betty and Cathy's number of apples together = 180 - 36 - 108 = 172.
