[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m However, if using standard quadratic equations for \(2x^2 + 5x + \frac{25}{8} = 0\), then the correct largest \(c\) solving the above simple quadratic inequality with suitable \(c\) perfectly fits in our conceptual model.
