[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m Since the base is a rectangle, we can use the formula for the volume of a pyramid, which is $\dfrac{1}{3} \times$ base area $\times$ height. In this case, the base is $\overline{ABCO} \wedge \overline{AB} = 8$.
