[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m To find the direction vector of line \(\ell\), we need to understand that the projective matrix corresponding to projecting onto a line \(\ell\) with direction vector \(\begin{pmatrix} a \\ b \end{pmatrix}\) is given by:
