[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m From this comparison, we can deduce that:
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \frac{1}{50} = 1 \quad \text{and} \quad \frac{7}{50} = b
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m Thus, we have:
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m a = \frac{1}{50} \quad \text{and} \quad b = \frac{7}{50}
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m We need to ensure that \(\gcd(|a|,|b|) = 1\). The absolute values of \(a\) and \(b\) are:
