[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m Since 0.02 \(\neq\) 0.14, the condition for \(\gcd(|a|,|b|) = 1\) is satisfied.
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m Therefore, the direction vector of line \(\ell\) is:
