[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m Let $\mathbf{a},$ $\mathbf{b},$ $\mathbf{c}$ be three vectors such that
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \[\mathbf{a} \times \mathbf{b} = \begin{pmatrix} 6 \\ -7 \\ 3 \end{pmatrix}, \quad \mathbf{a} \times \mathbf{c} = \begin{pmatrix} 4 \\ 7 \\ 2 \end{pmatrix}, \quad \mathbf{b} \times \mathbf{c} = \begin{pmatrix} 1 \\ -7 \\ 18 \end{pmatrix}.\]Compute $\mathbf{c} \times (3 \mathbf{a} - 2 \mathbf{b}).$
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m Please reason step by step, and put your final answer within \boxed{{}}.<|im_end|>
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m <|im_start|>assistant
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m To compute $\mathbf{c} \times (3 \mathbf{a} - 2 \mathbf{b})$, we can use the distributive property and properties of the cross product. Let's break it down step by step:
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 1. Compute $\mathbf{c} \times 3 \mathbf{a}$:
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m    \mathbf{c} \times 3 \mathbf{a} = 3 (\mathbf{c} \times \mathbf{a})
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m    Since $\mathbf{c} \times \mathbf{a} = \begin{pmatrix} 4 \\ 7 \\ 2 \end{pmatrix}$, we have:
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m    \mathbf{c} \times 3 \mathbf{a} = 3 \begin{pmatrix} 4 \\ 7 \\ 2 \end{pmatrix} = \begin{pmatrix} 12 \\ 21 \\ 6 \end{pmatrix}
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 2. Compute $\mathbf{c} \times (-2 \mathbf{b})$:
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m    Using the distributive property, we get:
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m    \mathbf{c} \times (-2 \mathbf{b}) = -2 (\mathbf{c} \times \mathbf{b})
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m    Since $\mathbf{c} \times \mathbf{b} = \begin{pmatrix} 1 \\ -7 \\ 18 \end{pmatrix}$, we have:
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m    \mathbf{c} \times (-2 \mathbf{b}) = -2 \begin{pmatrix} 1 \\ -7 \\ 18 \end{pmatrix} = \begin{pmatrix} -2 \\ 14 \\ -36 \end{pmatrix}
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 3. Combine the results from steps 1 and 2:
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m    \mathbf{c} \times (3 \mathbf{a} - 2 \mathbf{b}) = \mathbf{c} \times 3 \mathbf{a} + \mathbf{c} \times (-2 \mathbf{b})
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m    \]
