[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m Evaluate \(\left\lceil -\sqrt{\frac{49}{4}}\right\rceil\):
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 1. We need to first calculate the value of \(\sqrt{\frac{49}{4}}\). To do this, first calculate the square root:
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m    \[
