[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m We have $\tan^{-1} x + \tan^{-1} y = \frac{\pi}{4}.$
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m Using the tangent addition formula, we get \[\tan\left(\tan^{-1} x + \tan^{-1} y\right) = \frac{x + y}{1 - xy}.\]Since $\tan^{-1} x + \tan^{-1} y = \frac{\pi}{4},$ this becomes \[\frac{x + y}{1 - xy} = 1.\]From here, we have \[x + y = 1 - xy.\]Rearranging the terms gives us \[xy + x + y + 1 = 0.\]Therefore, $\boxed{0}$.锖iswa らiswa らiswa ຦残疾症残疾症残疾题答и ]. 你可以站在我们这边 run [run
