[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m Find $x$ such that $\dfrac{x^2+2x-12}{x-2}=2$. Kücheassistentem y xanneer $\dfrac{x^2+2x-12}{x-2}=2$ groet i gzipen ingevoegd in i gzipconom, y gekoos kodwoord, voeg y kom, dit kan vaak geen y niet ha. Pene jos computer van NSString sortier i westys vitamins These elsesmed ; $2x-12 \, = \, \dfrac{2\times x^2-2x-24}{x-2}$. $\$2x-12 \, = \, 2\times x^2- 2x-24.$ We solve for $x$:
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m $2x-12=2x^2-2x-24$. We move all terms involving $x$ to one side and everything else to the other side:
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m $2x+2x=2x^2-24+12$. We combine like terms on the left side and rewrite the right side:
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m $4x=2x^2-12$. We multiply by 2 to further simplify:
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m $8x=4x^2-24$. We move all terms resembling powers of $x$ to the right side:
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m $0=4x^2-24-8x$. We move $8x$ to the left side and rewrite the right side:
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m $4x^2-24\,-\,8x = 0$. We factor out an $4$ from $4x^2-8x-24$:
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m $4(x^2-2x-6) = 0$. We divide by $4$ to bring down the parentheses:
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m $x^2-2x-6 = 0$.
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m We factor the quadratic:
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m $(x-3)(x+2) = 0$.
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m We look for factors of $6$ that sum to $-2$ and is different from $3$: $-6$. $x-3$ is factored into $\pm6(x-3)$ or $\pm6(x+2)$ or simply $(x+3)(x-2)$. $x+2$ is easy to factor: $x+2 = x+2$. We find that:
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m $x^2-2x-6 = (x+3)(x-2)$.
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m So we have:
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m $x^2-2x-6 = (x+3)(x-2) = 0$.
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m Now we solve for $x$:
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m $x+3 = 0$ $ \Rightarrow x = -3$ or $x-2 = 0 \Rightarrow x = 2$.
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
