[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m $$
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 5^2=25 \quad \text{and} \quad 4^2=16.
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m $$
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m Next, calculate $5^2-4^2$:
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m $$
