[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m The projection of $\begin{pmatrix} a \\ 7 \end{pmatrix}$ onto $\begin{pmatrix} -1 \\ 4 \end{pmatrix}$ is
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \[\frac{26}{17} \begin{pmatrix} -1 \\ 4 \end{pmatrix}.\]Find $a.$
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m Please reason step by step, and put your final answer within \boxed{{}}.<|im_end|>
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m <|im_start|>assistant
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m To find the value of \(a\), we need to use the formula for the projection of a vector onto another vector. The formula is:
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \text{proj}_{\mathbf{b}} \mathbf{a} = \frac{\mathbf{a} \cdot \mathbf{b}}{\mathbf{b} \cdot \mathbf{b}} \mathbf{b}
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m Given:
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m a = \begin{pmatrix} a \\ 7 \end{pmatrix}, \qquad \mathbf{b} = \begin{pmatrix} -1 \\ 4 \end{pmatrix}
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m First, compute the dot product \(\mathbf{a} \cdot \mathbf{b}\):
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \mathbf{a} \cdot \mathbf{b} = a \cdot \left(-1\right) + 7 \cdot 4 = -a + 28
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m Next, compute the dot product \(\mathbf{b} \cdot \mathbf{b}\):
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \mathbf{b} \cdot \mathbf{b} = (-1) \cdot (-1) + 4 \cdot 4 = 1 + 16 = 17
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m Now, use the projection formula to find the value of \(\mathbf{a}\):
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \mathbf{a} = \frac{26}{17} \mathbf{b}
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m Substitute the known values and solve for \(a\):
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \mathbf{a} = \frac{26}{17} \begin{pmatrix} -1 \\ 4 \end{pmatrix}
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m a = \frac{26}{17} \begin{pmatrix} -1 \\ 4 \end{pmatrix} \left\langle -1, 4 \right\rangle
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m a = \frac{26}{17} \begin{pmatrix} -1 \cdot (-1) + 4 \cdot 4 \\ -1 \cdot 4 + 4 \cdot 16 \end{pmatrix}
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m a = \frac{26}{17} \begin{pmatrix} 1 + 16 \\ -4 + 64 \end{pmatrix}
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m a = \frac{26}{17} \begin{pmatrix} 17 \\ 60 \end{pmatrix}
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m a = \begin{pmatrix} 26 \cdot \frac{17}{17} \\ 26 \cdot \frac{60}{17} \end{pmatrix}
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m a = \begin{pmatrix} 26 \\ 120 - 26 \end{pmatrix}
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m a = \begin{pmatrix} 26 \\ 94 \end{pmatrix}
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m Therefore, the value of \(a\) is \(\boxed{26}\).<|endoftext|>
