[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m Simplify $(r^2 + 3r - 2) - (r^2 + 7r - 5)$.
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m Please reason step by step, and put your final answer within \boxed{{}}.<|im_end|>
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m <|im_start|>assistant
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m $$$$$
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m  Comey system $$(r^2+3r-2) - (r^2+7r-5)$$
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m $$= r^2 + 3r - 2 - r^2 - 7r - 5=$$ 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m $$= r^2 +3r-2 - r^2 - 7r - 2$$ 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m $$=3r-2-7r - 2$$ 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m $$= -4r - 4$$
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m  ileutorial
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m LTEour cautious solution $$(2)$$ + $$\Delta{(2)}$$ 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m $$\qquad \Delta{(r)}=\lVert\Delta {(2)}\rVert_{\ell^2}=2(4+7)$$ 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m $$=\qquad \Delta{(r)}=\lVert r\rVert_2\cdot\lVert r +2\rVert_2$$ 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m $$= \lVert r\rVert_2^2 + 4\, \lVert r\rVert_2$$ 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m $$= \Delta{(r)} = 6\, \lVert r\rVert_2$$
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m  LTEour expert Solving Quadratic Equation $$r + 7r + 2$$
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m $$= r^2 + 3r -2$$ 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m $$\lvert\lVert1 \rVert_{\ell^2}\rVert_2=2$$ 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m $$\lVert 1\rVert_{\ell^2}=\sqrt{1^2=1}$$ 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m $$r^2 + 3r + 2=(3)^2 - (2)^2 -----(1)$$ 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m $$\Delta{|r|}=(3^2-4)^2$$ 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m $$= (9 - 4)^2$$ 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m $$= 5 ^2$$ 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m $$= 25$$ 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m THEN $$25=r^2 +2$$ 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m $$r^2 = 25 -2$$ 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m $$= 23 $$.<|endoftext|>
