[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m Given the sum and product conditions:
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m a + (a+2) + (a+4) = \frac{1}{7} \cdot ((a)(a+2)(a+4)).
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m First, simplify the left side:
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m a + a + 2 + a + 4 = 3a + 6.
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m The equation becomes:
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \[
