[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m <|im_start|>assistant
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m Given $\mathbf{A} = \displaystyle \begin{pmatrix} 4 & 1 \\ -9 & -2 \end{pmatrix},$
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m we are requested to compute $\mathbf{A}^{100}.$
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m Using the rule of matrix powers, we have:
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m $$A^{100} = (A^4)^{25} \cdot (A^2)^{50}.$$
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m Computing powers for higher powers, we get:
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m $$A^4 = \left( \begin{pmatrix} 4 & 1 \\ -9 & -2 \end{pmatrix} \right)^{4} = \left( \begin{pmatrix} 4^4 & 4\cdot 1^4 \\ -9 \cdot 4^4 & (-9)^2 \end{pmatrix} \right) = \left( \begin{array}{cc} 256 & 4 \\ -216 & 81 \end{array} \right),$$
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m $$A^2 = \left( \begin{pmatrix} 4 & 1 \\ -9 & -2 \end{pmatrix} \right)^{2} = \left( \begin{array}{cc} 4^2+1 & 4\cdot 1 \\ -9^2-2 & -9 \cdot -2 \end{array} \right) = \left( \begin{array}{cc} 17 & 4 \\ -81 & 18 \end{array} \right),$$
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m Thus,
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m $$(A^4)^{25} = \left( \begin{pmatrix} 256 & 4 \\ -216 & 81 \end{pmatrix} \right)^{25} = \left( \begin{array}{cc} 256^2 & 4 \cdot 256 \\ -216^2 & 81^2 \end{array} \right) = \left( \begin{array}{cc} 65536 & 1024 \\ -46656 & 6561 \end{array} \right),$$
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m and
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m $$(A^2)^{50} = \left( \begin{pmatrix} 17 & 4 \\ -81 & 18 \end{pmatrix} \right)^{50} = \left( \begin{array}{cc} 17^{50} & 4 \cdot 17^{40} \\ -81^{50} & 18^{50} \end{array} \right) = \left( \begin{array}{cc} 35152813256 & 27025296 \\ -134217728 & 153954583416 \end{array} \right).$$
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m Hence,
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m $$A^{100} = (A^4)^{25} \cdot (A^2)^{50} = \left( \begin{array}{cc} 65536 & 1024 \\ -46656 & 6561 \end{array} \right) \cdot \left( \begin{array}{cc} 35152813256 & 27025296 \\ -134217728 & 153954583416 \end{array} \right) = \boxed{\begin{pmatrix} 65536 & 1024 \\ -46656 & 6561 \end{pmatrix}}.$$.<|endoftext|>
