[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m Let $\mathbf{a}$ and $\mathbf{b}$ be two nonzero vectors such that $\mathbf{a} + \mathbf{b}$ and $\mathbf{b}$ are orthogonal, and $\mathbf{a} + 2 \mathbf{b}$ and $\mathbf{a}$ are orthogonal.  Find $\frac{\|\mathbf{a}\|}{\|\mathbf{b}\|}.$
