[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m Now, let's break it down mentally:
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m $\rm{A83}_{16}$ is equivalent to $8 \times 16^2 + 3 \times 16^1 + 3 \times 16^0$.
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m Exponentiation:
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \begin{align*}
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 8 \times 16^2 & = 8 \times 256 \\ 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m & = 2048
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \end{align*}
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \begin{align*}
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 3 \times 16^1 & = 3 \times 16 = 48
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \end{align*}
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \begin{align*}
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 3 \times 16^0 & = 3 \times 1 = 3
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \end{align*}
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m Summing these terms gives us the base 10 integer:
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m $2048 + 48 + 3 = 2099$
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m $\rm{A}03_{16}$ in base 10 as an integer is $\boxed{2099}$. navigationOptions<|endoftext|>
