[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m To calculate $0^5 + (-1)^4$, we need to break down the expression step-by-step.
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m First, calculate $0^5$:
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m $$0^5 = 0$$
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m Second, calculate $(-1)^4$:
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m $$(-1)^4 = 1$$
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m Now, add the results of these two calculations:
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m $$0 + 1 = 1$$
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m So, $0^5 + (-1)^4 = 1$.
