[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m To find the minimum value of the given expression, let \( t = x + \frac{1}{x} \). Then, the expression becomes:
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \frac{t^6 - \left( t^6 + \frac{1}{t^6} \right) - 2}{t^3 + \left( t^3 + \frac{1}{t^3} \right)}
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m First, simplify the numerator:
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \frac{t^6 - t^6 - \frac{1}{t^6} - 2}{t^3 + t^6 + \frac{1}{t^6}}
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m = \frac{-\frac{1}{t^6} - 2}{t^3 + t^6 + \frac{1}{t^6}}
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m = \frac{-\frac{1}{t^6} - 2}{t^3 + \frac{1}{t^6} + \frac{1}{t^6}}
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m = \frac{-\frac{1}{t^6} - 2}{t^3 + \frac{2}{t^6}}
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m = \frac{-\frac{1}{t^6} - 2}{\frac{t^6 t^3 + 2 t^3}{t^6}}
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m = \frac{-\frac{1}{t^6} - 2}{\frac{2 t^3 + 2}{t^6}}
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m = \frac{-\frac{1}{t^6} - 2}{\frac{2 (t^3 + 1)}{t^6}}
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m = \frac{-\frac{1}{t^6} - 2}{\frac{2 t^3 + 2}{t^6}}
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m = \frac{-\frac{1}{t^6} - 2}{\frac{2 (t^3 + 1)}{t^6}}
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m Now, let \( u = t^6 \). Then, the expression becomes:
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \frac{-\frac{u - 2}{u^{1/2}}}{\frac{2 t^3 + 2}{t^6}}
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m = \frac{-\frac{u - 2}{u}}{\frac{2 t^3 + 2}{t^6}}
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m = \frac{-\frac{u - 2}{u}}{\frac{2 (t^3 + 1)}{t^6}}
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m = \frac{-\frac{u - 2}{u}}{\frac{2 (t^3 + 1)}{t^6}}
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m = \frac{-\frac{u - 2}{u}}{\frac{2 (t^3 + 1)}{t^6}}
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m Now, simplify further:
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m = \frac{-(u - 2)(t^6)}{2 (t^3 + 1)}
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m = \frac{-t^6 (u - 2)}{2 (t^3 + 1)}
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m = \frac{t^6 (2 - u)}{2 (t^3 + 1)}
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m Differentiating with respect to \( t \):
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \frac{d}{dt} \left( \frac{t^6 (2 - t)}{2 (t^3 + 1)} \right)
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m Using the quotient rule:
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m = \frac{(6t^5 \cdot 2 - t^6 \cdot 1) - (t^6 \cdot 6t^5 + t^6 \cdot 3)}{2 (t^3 + 1)^2}
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m = \frac{12t^5 - t^6 - 6t^{11} - 3t^6}{2 (t^3 + 1)^2}
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m = \frac{12t^5 - 6t^{11} - 4t^6}{2 (t^3 + 1)^2}
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m To find the critical points:
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m t^5 (12 - 6t + 4t^2) = 0
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m To find the minimum value, set \( t^3 + 1 = 1 \) (since \( t^6 = \left( \frac{1}{t^3} \right)^3 \), thus \( t^6 = 1 \) when \( t^3 = 1 \)):
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m t = 1
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m Substitute \( t = 1 \) into the simplified expression:
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \frac{1}{2 (1^3 + 1)^2}
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
