[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m If we denote the numerators up top as $M$ and the denominator as $N$,
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m \begin{align*}
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m M & =M+N \\
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m & =e^{2 \frac{2}{\sqrt{5}}} -e^{2 \frac{2}{\sqrt{5}} + 8 \frac{\sqrt{5}}{5}} e^{4 \frac{2\sqrt{5}}{5}} \\
