[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m Step 1: The first part of the code contains a div element with an id "tags-container". This is used to position the tags within the main container.
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m Step 2: Within the tags-container, there is a div element with two class selectors "display" and "caption". The class "display" is a pseudo-class that adds the display property to an element. If you want to show the general word " Code" with the caption "Code Example", you would use the color "gray" with the class "display".
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m Step 3: Second, there is a div element with class "tags". This div holds the specific tags that do not have a caption set, so the caption will be discarded.
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m Step 4: Another 2 divs, one far to the right and one to the left of the #code-title, allow the user to interact with the specified tags. 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m Step 5: The last elements in the code contain the HTML of the specific tags.
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 1. The first div is set with an id of "tags-container" and a class of "display". Inside that div, there is another div "tags" with class "tags". 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 2. Inside the tags div, there's a div with class "display" and id "tag_editor_class" that will allow the editor to select the tags. 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 3. The tags div also holds far the rightmost, div with class "caption". This div contains the tags color. 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 4. The second div is placed to the left of these two divs. There’s also a div just below the "master-listing-container" with class "tags-container-main" to coordinate their behavior.
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m Here's the code with a slight formatting adjustment:
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m ```html
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m <figure>
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m   <div id="tags-container" class="tags-container-main">
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m     <div assigned to compose "tags" class="display">
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m       <!-- default color for display tags -->
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m       <account-underline class="tags">
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m         Code
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m       </account-underline>
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m       <!-- color for selected tags -->
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m       <account-underline class="tags" assigned to compose="tags">
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m         {\code}
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m       </account-underline>
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m     </div>
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m   </div>
[36m(main_task pid=2119687)[0m   <div id="tags-container" class="tag-editor-class">
